One record per chain, named after the `--rpc-url` alias: `base-sepolia.json`,
`robinhood-testnet.json`. DeployFactory.s.sol writes the one for the chain it
ran on and CreateToken.s.sol updates it with the most recent launch. Commit it
once it exists, so the frontend and the interaction scripts read the same
address.

A record with an empty `factory` is a placeholder for a chain nothing has been
deployed to yet: `lib/contracts/deployment.ts` reads it as "no factory here"
and the site drops that chain from the launch picker. Deploying fills it in.
